OL,3,GNEWSA'I want change and new law after
OL,4,Adaughter's death'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose 13-year-old daughter
OL,7,Ftook her own life is calling for
OL,8,Fmandatory risk assessments carried out
OL,9,Fby a trained professional if a young
OL,10,Fperson says they intend to kill
OL,11,Fthemselves.
OL,13,FNatalie James' daughter Ella took her
OL,14,Fown life in 2023. James has since
OL,15,Fgathered more than 10,000 signatures on
OL,16,Fa petition asking the government to
OL,17,Fmake suicide risk assessments a legal
OL,18,Frequirement.
OL,20,F"I don't want sympathy. I want change,"
OL,21,Fshe said.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
