OL,3,GNEWSA'I want change and new law after
OL,4,Adaughter's death'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department of Health and Social Care
OL,7,Fspokesperson said its thoughts were
OL,8,Fwith Ella's family and it was "vital
OL,9,Fthat any concerns about a young
OL,10,Fperson's mental health are taken
OL,11,Fseriously and acted on".
